WEBVTT

00:01.268 --> 00:03.443
There's no way that
a mouse could kill a scorpion.

00:03.515 --> 00:05.200
A mouse's got sharp claws and teeth.

00:05.258 --> 00:07.001
- A rat can kill a scorpion.
- No shit,

00:07.205 --> 00:09.494
we're not talking about a rat,
but about a little mouse.

00:09.640 --> 00:11.214
A rat still would lose.

00:11.776 --> 00:15.301
A little mouse fighting a scorpion.
And that is final!

00:15.563 --> 00:16.705
Stop!

00:18.066 --> 00:20.640
Shut up!
Oh, my God, I don't care.

00:21.136 --> 00:23.351
All we're doing is arguing about
the most stupid shit!

00:23.613 --> 00:25.698
A rat, a scorpion, I don't care, man!

00:26.020 --> 00:27.777
When did this start happening?

00:27.827 --> 00:30.053
When did we start arguing all
the time and fighting?

00:30.153 --> 00:31.234
This isn't like us.

00:31.796 --> 00:34.112
Look, we're working our asses
off in this bar, you know,

00:34.282 --> 00:36.859
we're getting nothing to show for it,
so we're starting to snip

00:37.001 --> 00:38.745
and pick at each other, it's bullshit.

00:38.803 --> 00:41.048
'Cause guess what?
It's a beautiful day outside, okay?

00:41.275 --> 00:43.955
We need to change things up.
Let's go outside.

00:44.055 --> 00:45.352
Let's get some fresh air.

00:45.410 --> 00:47.372
Let's run around a little bit,
you know?

00:47.488 --> 00:49.404
Let's just do something different.

00:50.636 --> 00:52.819
You know what, Charlie,
you're right, this is great.

00:52.869 --> 00:54.879
It's nice to do something
different for a change.

00:55.144 --> 00:57.252
Yeah, enjoy a little blue sky,
some fresh air.

00:57.329 --> 00:59.108
Some Earth beneath our feet.

00:59.180 --> 01:01.347
- See, I told you guys you'd like it.
- Yeah.

01:04.680 --> 01:06.018
It's goddamn bright out here.

01:06.280 --> 01:09.021
- It's so bright. It hurts my eyes.
- It's blinding!

01:09.283 --> 01:12.066
- People are playing football.
- It's like there's no room to drink.

01:12.328 --> 01:14.152
I would like to go back to the bar.

01:14.414 --> 01:15.903
Let's go back to the bar.

01:16.165 --> 01:17.411
Are you kidding me?

01:17.800 --> 01:19.365
Oh, look out.

01:20.032 --> 01:21.033
Can I get that back?

01:21.295 --> 01:23.375
Yeah, go long and I'll toss
you a wicked spiral.

01:23.490 --> 01:26.247
Wanna just give me the ball, dude?
We're trying to practice.

01:26.509 --> 01:29.083
- What are you practicing for?
- I'm trying out for the Eagles.

01:30.022 --> 01:33.504
- Uh, the Philadelphia Eagles?
- Yeah.

01:33.766 --> 01:35.746
They're holding tryouts
for the public.

01:35.829 --> 01:37.433
Like in that movie, Invincible.

01:38.771 --> 01:42.005
The one with the guy from the New Kids
on the Block makes it onto the Eagles?

01:42.106 --> 01:43.389
- I saw that.
- That's the one.

01:43.651 --> 01:45.579
A good one.
So they're actually doing that?

01:45.772 --> 01:47.255
Just give me the football.

01:48.580 --> 01:51.982
Well, Dennis, I think you
know what we have to do.

01:53.703 --> 01:56.573
Transcript: www.swsub.com

01:56.847 --> 01:59.530
Subtitles: Ju
www.top-series.net

02:23.870 --> 02:25.545
