Shut up! I don't care.
Go in their camper.

13:12.138 --> 13:15.339
Get out of here!
Oh, you sick son of a bitch, dude.

13:15.389 --> 13:18.966
Why would you...?
Oh, shit. Oh, shit!

13:22.143 --> 13:24.614
- You ready to quit yet, Cole?
- You had enough yet, Cole?

13:24.664 --> 13:25.674
Yeah, Cole.

13:25.936 --> 13:28.635
- You ran for ten minutes.
- My side is going to explode.

13:28.897 --> 13:31.545
You're in terrible shape.
This is gonna be easier than I thought.

13:33.476 --> 13:36.303
- Let's go! Move it, come on.
- Oh, so much pain.

13:37.383 --> 13:39.486
All right, now we've got
our hearts pumping.

13:39.587 --> 13:43.108
Let's pick out some gear,
pick a partner... hitting drill!

13:43.797 --> 13:44.890
I pick Cole.

13:48.193 --> 13:50.765
Oh, no, he did it.

13:50.887 --> 13:52.662
That's my dance.
That's my signature dance.

13:52.742 --> 13:54.286
I wanna do that when I tackle people.

13:54.548 --> 13:56.927
I like your form, I liked how you went
before the whistle.

13:56.984 --> 13:58.749
- Goddamn right.
- Nice.

14:00.074 --> 14:02.351
All right, guys,
let's pick new partners.

14:05.908 --> 14:10.385
Eenie, meanie, miney, mo.

14:15.102 --> 14:17.935
Nice. All right, you're up, man.

14:20.835 --> 14:23.231
Hitting's not really my thing, Coach.

14:23.493 --> 14:26.485
Spoken like a true champion.
You just might make the team.

14:27.161 --> 14:30.661
- Awesome. Really?
- Jesus Christ.

14:31.899 --> 14:36.422
Okay, Frank, that was easy...
now just exit, don't talk to anybody.

14:37.140 --> 14:38.828
These people are freak shows.

14:39.087 --> 14:41.176
Wait... better wash your hands.

14:41.464 --> 14:44.013
No telling what kind of germs
these McPoyles have.

14:50.608 --> 14:52.388
I'm starting to feel weird.

14:54.613 --> 14:56.014
What the hell? Not again.

14:56.615 --> 14:58.701
Oh, no! Hey!

15:02.339 --> 15:04.010
Somebody get me out of here!

15:05.596 --> 15:07.589
Man, my brother just leveled
your boy out there.

15:07.639 --> 15:09.305
He's going to make the Eagles.

15:09.419 --> 15:12.533
Your boy is a pansy,
but Doyle's a big, strong guy.

15:12.611 --> 15:13.865
'Cause he eats all that fish.

15:14.127 --> 15:15.649
Is he just going to talk at me?

15:15.699 --> 15:17.199
I am going to lose my shit.

15:17.649 --> 15:19.496
What's going on with his head?
It's too small

15:19.802 --> 15:22.040
or tight or something.
Yeah, that's it.

15:22.302 --> 15:23.583
His skin is too tight.

15:24.283 --> 15:25.544
My skin's not tight.

15:29.889 --> 15:33.176
Good catch, Doyle!
Good catch! Way to hustle!

15:33.450 --> 15:35.650
Way to hustle!
All right, who's next?

15:35.794 --> 15:36.826
This guy.

15:39.794 --> 15:41.601
All right, run out and hook
in.

15:41.863 --> 15:45.022
Run out and hook in. Show these people
how to play football.

15:46.939 --> 15:49.797
I'm going to make Mac look so bad.
My form is perfect.

15:49.869 --> 15:52.865
I'm like Jerry Rice.
Feel that stride.

15:53.182 --> 15:54.853
So fluid and fast.

15:55.170 --> 15:59.014
I've got the stride of a gazelle...
a beautiful, beautiful gazelle person.

15:59.450 --> 16:02.227
My body is achieving a perfect
symmetry right now.

16:02.574 --> 16:05.380
It's that long, lean muscle I've
worked so hard to achieve.

16:05.885 --> 16:07.367
I should have popped my shirt off.

16:07.468 --> 16:10.047
Goddamn it, I really should have
popped that shirt off.

16:10.309 --> 16:13.216
I wonder if any women are
watching from the sidelines.

16:18.083 --> 16:20.563
All right, Dee, you can do this.
You can kick a football.

16:20.635 --> 16:22.839
You're better at sports
than Mac and Dennis.

16:25.699 --> 16:28.148
Holy shit!

16:28.710 --> 16:30.484
The other coach has got to hear
about this.

16:33.075 --> 16:36.057
Well, well, look who's a natural.

16:36.732 --> 16:39.267
Guess I'll be getting further
than you, after all.

16:41.356 --> 16:42.996
- Maybe it was a lucky kick?
- No.

16:43.258 --> 16:45.195
Those stork-like legs,
they act like pendulums,

16:45.267 --> 16:48.738
and on the bottoms of those
pendulums, feet like wrecking balls.

16:50.189 --> 16:51.831
We got to do something
about this, dude.

16:51.887 --> 16:53.882
Let's go talk to Frank.
Come on, I got an idea.

16:54.699 --> 16:55.699
Somebody!

16:56.264 --> 16:57.594
Somebody help!

16:57.997 --> 16:59.136
Goddamn it!

16:59.596 --> 17:01.306
Goddamn it, not again!

17:05.920 --> 17:07.087
Frank.

17:08.412 --> 17:09.637
Hey, Frank.

17:10.357 --> 17:11.511
Who said that?

17:12.120 --> 17:14.450
I'm Artemis. I'm Dee's friend.

17:16.167 --> 17:18.659
- I'm trapped.
- I know,

17:19.222 --> 17:20.478
but I can help.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.421
Crawl into my mouth.

17:23.934 --> 17:25.517
I don't think I could fit.

17:26.207 --> 17:29.459
Sure you will.
Just go one leg at a time.

17:31.494 --> 17:33.497
Okay.

17:35.470 --> 17:40.392
Into the toilet I go.

17:44.528 --> 17:48.244
Man, this is crazy. You are dancing
with the entire McPoyle family.

17:48.373 --> 17:50.831
These people are freak
shows, man. Freaks.

17:51.053 --> 17:53.316
But you're keeping your cool,
you're keeping your cool.

17:53.578 --> 17:56.461
You know why?
Because you are the Green Man.

17:56.887 --> 17:59.387
Green Man is saving your life
right now, bro.

17:59.451 --> 18:01.049
Just go with the flow.

18:01.556 --> 18:03.648
Charlie, we've been looking
all over for you, dude.

18:03.698 --> 18:05.245
Green Man, I knew you couldn't resist.

18:05.507 --> 18:06.509
Huh?

18:06.581 --> 18:08.582
I'm actually tripping
pretty hard right now.

18:08.844 --> 18:10.096
You're tripping?

18:10.197 --> 18:13.954
Yeah, Frank gave me some acid
and it's like... whoo!

18:14.170 --> 18:15.337
Hey, guys.

18:16.014 --> 18:17.814
Guess who got invited
to training camp.

18:17.901 --> 18:19.117
We're going to be famous.

18:19.167 --> 18:21.386
Look, we need to talk to Green Man
alone for a second.

18:21.458 --> 18:22.470
Thank you? Yes, bye.

18:22.736 --> 18:25.500
Can we talk to the Green Man?
Let's go. Thank you.

18:25.572 --> 18:27.935
- Where is Frank? It's very important.
- Really important.

18:28.007 --> 18:30.520
Oh, Frank?
Oh, he's standing right there.

18:33.976 --> 18:35.524
Frank, what the hell are you doing?

18:35.625 --> 18:38.236
He's been trying to climb through
that trash can for 20 minutes.

18:38.895 --> 18:40.509
I'm pretty sure he's on acid.

18:40.624 --> 18:43.867
Thank God, you guys are here.
How'd you get in here?

18:44.129 --> 18:45.327
What are you talking about?

18:45.589 --> 18:49.357
- I've been stuck for 3 hours.
- I think he took a dump in there.

18:49.458 --> 18:51.760
- Can you give us a second, please?
- Whatever.

18:51.841 --> 18:53.987
I'm getting tired
of watching him anyway.

18:54.203 --> 18:56.213
Frank, listen.
Did you bring your gun today?

18:57.642 --> 18:59.177
Great. Now walk me through the plan.

18:59.249 --> 19:01.024
The plan is:
I get close to Dee, all right.

19:01.074 --> 19:03.245
She goes to punt the ball,
I fire, it'll startle her,

19:03.303 --> 19:04.830
- she'll blow the kick.
- Great plan.

19:04.890 --> 19:07.279
Wait a second. How long have we
been standing right here?

19:07.365 --> 19:09.267
- Like, two seconds.
- Seriously?

19:09.529 --> 19:11.232
Frank, give me the gun.
We're in a hurry.

19:11.290 --> 19:12.603
- Where is it?
- In your hand.

19:12.782 --> 19:14.064
Wait, wait!

19:14.326 --> 19:15.963
When the hell did I put Green Man on?

19:16.013 --> 19:17.827
- I don't know.
- That lizard talks!

19:18.580 --> 19:20.487
Where?! I don't like lizards!

19:20.749 --> 19:22.636
We don't have time.
Frank, give us the gun!

19:24.393 --> 19:26.972
Lizard, am I standing in poop?

19:27.761 --> 19:30.705
I'm about to demonstrate to all of you
my natural abilities as a punter.

19:30.967 --> 19:33.535
I'm gonna kick this ball 60 yards right
in front of your faces,

19:33.593 --> 19:34.831
and I'm gonna do it...

19:36.762 --> 19:38.046
as a woman.

19:38.825 --> 19:41.132
Oh, that's right.
I'm a woman!

19:41.394 --> 19:44.302
And I'm about to show all of you
that women should be allowed

19:44.389 --> 19:46.763
to try out for
the Philadelphia Eagles. Coach?

19:52.087 --> 19:53.818
Wrap your minds around this.

19:55.852 --> 19:56.861
Damn!

19:56.933 --> 19:59.150
Oh, I broke my...
Oh, I maybe broke it.

19:59.898 --> 20:02.012
Oh, sweet Jesus, I think I broke it.

20:03.041 --> 20:05.531
- Keep your legs.
- All right, you're out of the trash.

20:05.589 --> 20:07.200
A deal is a deal. Give us the gun.

20:07.462 --> 20:09.906
Hold on. I'm really peek in here.

20:10.636 --> 20:13.415
Stop pointing the gun at us.
Point it at someone else.

20:13.677 --> 20:15.530
Nobody minds making
a little dance right now.

20:15.588 --> 20:18.023
- Nobody cares of you dancing, Charlie.
- Hey, guys.

20:18.148 --> 20:19.713
Could somebody take me to the hospital?

20:19.768 --> 20:21.900
I'm pretty sure I broke
every single bone in my foot

20:21.958 --> 20:23.481
- punting that football.
- Really?

20:23.539 --> 20:26.303
I didn't make it, but I'd like to go
to the E.R. right now, please.

20:26.622 --> 20:28.286
So your bonesaremade out of glass!

20:28.387 --> 20:29.389
Yes.

20:29.651 --> 20:31.321
No, my bones aren't...
You know what?

20:31.393 --> 20:33.683
It doesn't matter because
I made the furthest, so I win.

20:33.770 --> 20:36.338
I win, because you're the girl
and you got knocked unconscious.

20:36.396 --> 20:37.949
You got crushed, dude.

20:38.051 --> 20:40.659
That is so stupid! Guess what?
I made it the farthest.

20:43.097 --> 20:45.947
- You just shattered every bone...
- What are you talking about?

20:46.209 --> 20:48.456
Holy shit, this thing is loaded.

20:48.672 --> 20:51.190
- My leg!
- Doyle, are you okay?

20:51.265 --> 20:53.683
My leg! Somebody shot my leg!

20:54.144 --> 20:55.944
No!

20:58.013 --> 20:59.566
Oh, that's not good.

20:59.638 --> 21:01.958
No, that could come back
and bite us in the ass.

21:05.437 --> 21:06.790
- Ready? Go.
- Let's go!
